  "rules": [
    "Exploding weapon effects add Explosion Damage to the Damage and weapon-set damage percentages before the native minimum and rounded final hit.",
    "Explosion targets roll their own critical hits; a projectile critical hit does not force every explosion target critical.",
    "Fireworks counts kills in a single explosion instance, including neutral objects signaled as killed, and never combines attacks.",
    "Sticky Grenade disables its contact hitbox; original fuse0.75, stick radius40 points, follows the target offset and retains the last position on target death.",
    "The 15Hz server uses swept center-distance attachment checks to avoid tunneling; native frame/physics, projectile artwork upload and animation acceptance remain open."
  ],
